    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Server</h1><p>Join our Discord Server</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>First person wave-based shooter being made solo by Shape de Grilo. <br>You must survive alone or with a friend. Earn gold to buy weapons and random abilities called Engines and earn experience to level up and unlock skills. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single Player / Co-op <br></li><li> Wave System<br></li><li> Slow Time: slow motion zombie killing<br></li><li> 9 different fire arms.<br></li><li> Level System: Earn experience to level up and choose up to 10 different skill to modify your game <br></li><li> 6 small monsters and 2 Elite monsters<br></li><li> Ragdoll physics</li></ul>",
